      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "地元の猟師たちが、最近不猟で困ってるんだ。\nだから、昔やってた村のお祭りを復活させて\n今後の大猟を祈願したい考えなのさ。\nその祭りを盛り上げたい。踊り手を一人頼むよ！",
        "official_en": "The local hunters can't catch anything! We want to\nrevive an old tradition—putting on a festival to pray\nfor abundance. Would someone send a dancer to\nenliven the proceedings?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
